fibre-tlsverify and fibre-assign are independent re-implementations of
protocol logic that also appears in celestia-app. Each carries an in-repo
test that pins it to a specific celestia-app commit:

  - fibre-tlsverify/testdata/identity_vectors.json is a byte-for-byte copy of
    celestia-app's golden vectors at commit dba155084505a8f6c5d37260a94f70f939fb96de.
  - fibre-assign/reftest/ builds celestia-app v10.0.0-20260901162319-0b69316466c3
    from the module proxy and diffs against its real implementation.
